  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sierra Leone Artisanal Mining Community Development and Sustainable Livelihoods</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objectives of this project are to pilot community-driven capacity building, empowerment, and participatory decision-making in artisanal and small scale mining communities, enhance social accountability and promote closer cooperation on environmental and social challenges and increase the participation, and enhance the overall sustainable livelihoods of women and other vulnerable groups in artisanal communities. A parallel objective is to support the transition into alternative and more sustainable livelihoods, especially in the agriculture sector, for diamond ASM communities.</narrative>
  </description>
